{
 "schema": 1,
 "batch_name": "meridian-street-furniture-01",
 "backend": "local",
 "out_dir": "content/props",
 "_comment": [
  "THE BATCH THAT CAN RUN TONIGHT, on the machine this project actually has.",
  "Thirty-seven CC0 street props already in the repository, turned into a",
  "measured, pivoted, LOD'd, engine-neutral library. It needs Blender and",
  "nothing else: no download, no GPU, no account, no Claude tokens.",
  "",
  "WHY THESE AND NOT GENERATED ONES. The trellis backend needs an NVIDIA card",
  "with 16 GB (upstream's own number) and this project's machine is an AMD RX",
  "6700 with 9.98 GB and no C++ toolchain. The probe says so in one minute and",
  "refuses. That is not a reason to leave the night empty: D1 has the engine",
  "undecided, both candidates import GLB, and not one of these props has a",
  "measured bound, a pivot convention or an LOD chain today.",
  "",
  "NOTHING IS RESCALED, AND THAT IS A DECISION FROM A MEASUREMENT. The series",
  "printed by `meshgen.py --series ledger/Assets/Props/base-mesh` reads lamp",
  "post 3.00 m, skip 2.00x1.00x3.31 m, park bench 1.20x0.91 m, traffic cone",
  "0.45 m - real-world sizes, already in metres. So no target_height_m is set",
  "on any item: inventing one would be scaling a correct model to a number",
  "nobody measured. The field exists and is REQUIRED for the trellis backend,",
  "whose output is unit-less by construction.",
  "",
  "THE LOD LADDER IS PER ITEM AND COMES FROM THE MEASURED TRIANGLE COUNT.",
  "A rung is only added while it would leave at least 100 triangles, so a",
  "36-vertex awning gets LOD0 alone and a 4,492-triangle bin gets three rungs.",
  "6 items take one rung, 5 take two, 26 take three. A flat 0.5/0.25 ladder",
  "over everything would have produced five-triangle props and called it an",
  "optimisation.",
  "",
  "`measured_at_spec_time` is recorded so a later run can be compared against",
  "what was true when the batch was written. It is NOT read by the pipeline:",
  "every output is measured again from its own file."
 ],
 "default_lods": {
  "LOD0": 1.0,
  "LOD1": 0.5,
  "LOD2": 0.25
 },
 "default_pivot": "base-centre",
